# Hindsight memory — {{BANK_ID}}

This project's default Hindsight bank is `{{BANK_ID}}` (see `.hindsight.json`;
`memory_get_current_bank` lists every bank this project may use). Auto-recall and
auto-retain are off unless `.hindsight.json` turns them on.

## Initial pilot behavior

- `autoRecall` and `autoRetain` are false. Hooks are silent and make no network or token request.
- The generated `allowTools` policy is minimal and read-only. It deliberately excludes
  `memory_retain_batch` even though 3.7.0 still implements that planner.
- Repository config is not consent to enable automatic hooks or writes. A later operator decision
  must authorize write enablement and update policy separately.
- The client checks Hindsight API compatibility before its first bank request. It requires
  >=0.10.2 and <0.11.0.

Use `memory_recall`, `memory_list`, `memory_get`, and the other allowed reads deliberately. If the
bank is empty, do not create or seed it as part of this pilot.

## Mental models in this bank

The pilot may read existing pages with `mental_model_list` / `mental_model_get`. Creating or
refreshing a page is a write and needs later authorization.

## When to invoke an allowed tool

- `memory_recall(query)` — semantic lookup across existing memory.
- `memory_list(...)` / `memory_get(id)` — enumerate and inspect exact stored rows.
- `memory_operations(...)` — inspect background operation status.
- `mental_model_list()` / `mental_model_get(id)` — read existing synthesized pages.
- `directive_list()`, `bank_config_get()`, `document_list()` — inspect server state without
  changing it.

`BankGate` and tool policy are client-side controls, not server authorization. Other clients with
credentials remain outside them. For Codex or OMP direct MCP mode, register
`node /absolute/path/to/fpl-hsmem/dist/index.mjs` once in that runtime; do not add a legacy bank
environment selector.

## What NOT to store in this bank

- Contents of PRD/RFC/ADR — they live in `forge/` and are read via `Read`
- Global conventions — those belong in `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`
- Git history — `git log` has it
- `.mcp.json` config or env vars
- Secrets, tokens, credentials

## Diagnostics for this bank

```
memory_status            # health + statistics
memory_get_current_bank  # confirm bank_id
mental_model_list        # list living pages
```

Web UI with the memory graph: http://localhost:9999
